 prompt=f'Use case: illustration-story. Original horizontal 3:2 literary artwork for Kabita Live Issue33. Human Natural in Poetic Natural mode. Preserve the selected expressive medium; a painted interpretation, never documentary evidence.\nEmotional anchor: {reason}\nScene and medium: {scene}\nAnti-optimization checks: avoid staged object display, equal detail everywhere, mechanically repeated shapes, theatrical lighting and cosmetic distress. Material contact, geometry and illumination must make sense. Preserve quiet negative space and emotional ambiguity. No identifiable real people, portraits, readable text, signature, logos or watermark. Only the cropped fictional hand specified for the paper-boat scene may appear; no faces or real-person likenesses. Opaque ivory-paper background.\nPoem {d["title"]} by {d["author"]}; source read fully, use as context only, never render the words:\n{d["text"]}\n'
